    },
    "Ajoute un joueur" : {
      "comment" : "Placeholder of the field where a player's name is typed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add a player"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ajouter le joueur" : {
      "comment" : "Button that adds the typed player to the table.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add player"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aléatoire" : {
      "comment" : "Level that mixes soft and hot cards.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Random"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Au lit, en date, en sexto, réservé aux 18 ans et plus" : {
      "comment" : "Description of the Hot level of « They're a 10 but ».",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In bed, on dates, in sexts, for ages 18 and up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "C'est un" : {
      "comment" : "First line of the « They're a 10 but » tile on the home screen, above the big colored words.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "They're a"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "C'est un 10 mais" : {
      "comment" : "Name of the « They're a 10 but » game, used as a screen title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "They're a 10 But"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cartes jouées" : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility label of the progress bar of a party.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cards played"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chacun son tour, le joueur choisit Action ou Vérité. Une vérité se dit franchement, une action se fait jusqu'au bout. Tu refuses ? Tu bois les tises de la carte, sans discussion. Une carte ne te plaît pas ? Glisse-la vers la gauche pour la passer. Une tise d'eau, ça compte aussi." : {
      "comment" : "Rules of Truth or Dare, shown in an alert.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take turns picking Truth or Dare. A truth gets an honest answer, a dare gets done all the way. Refusing? Drink the sips on the card, no arguing. Don't like a card? Swipe it left to skip it. A sip of water counts too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chacun son tour, une question franche sur la table : tu réponds en désignant quelqu'un, ou tu bois les tises pour te taire. Sur un vote, si la majorité lève la main, la personne visée boit. Sur « À trois, pointez », la personne la plus désignée boit. En Couple, si vous vous désignez chacun, vous buvez tous les deux. Une carte ne te plaît pas ? Glisse-la vers la gauche pour la passer. Une tise d'eau, ça compte aussi." : {
      "comment" : "Rules of No Filter (Sans tact), shown in an alert.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take turns: a blunt question for the table. Answer by naming someone, or drink the sips to stay quiet. On a vote, if most hands go up, the person named drinks. On “On three, point”, whoever gets the most fingers drinks. In Couple mode, if you each point at the other, you both drink. Don't like a card? Swipe it left to skip it. A sip of water counts too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change entre femme et homme" : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility hint of a player card: a tap switches the player's sex.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switches between woman and man"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compris" : {
      "comment" : "Dismisses the rules alert.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Got it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couple" : {
      "comment" : "Audience of No Filter: a couple playing on their own.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couple"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Femme" : {
      "comment" : "Sex of a player: woman.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Woman"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fun et bon enfant, pour chauffer la table" : {
      "comment" : "Description of the Soft level.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Light and friendly, to warm up the table"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Goûts, manies et petits red flags, pour débattre entre potes" : {
      "comment" : "Description of the Soft level of « They're a 10 but ».",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tastes, quirks and small red flags, to argue about with friends"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hard" : {
